<title>USA: KISTA, Murray ISD, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</title>
<headline>KISTA, Murray ISD, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross, Sinclaire &amp; Associates, Inc said it won $4 million of Kentucky Interlocal School Transportation Association lease program revenue bonds, Series F for Murray Independent School District.</p>
</text>
